<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to make further provision with regard to
the equality of legal status of married persons; to repeal the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Married
Persons (Property and Torts) Act 1901</i></name></legref>; to amend
consequentially the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1970-052"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Supreme Court Act
1970</i></name></legref>; and for related purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


