<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_25d4cfa3-b92d-4cc3-9776-769ac4745e74"
id="sch.3-sec.2-he"><b>Abolition of common law and dispositions not
affected</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0fc6d53f-c88c-4e39-af42-904f204f9a84"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The repeal or amendment of an Act by this Act
does not revive any rule of the common law or equity abolished or otherwise
affected by this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0a1940e-af23-45b7-8288-ea16f17309c0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not affect the generality of
section 30 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1987-015"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_e423c18c-8207-48db-85ca-15ce830d455b"
id="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.2-note"><heading
guid="_bd10cd8c-223a-4622-a0be-d8dc6a1aa329"
id="sch.3-sec.2-ssec.2-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 30 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1987-015"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation
Act 1987</i></name></legref> preserves certain rights, privileges, obligations
and liabilities arising under a repealed Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.3-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7f42ea6b-8d12-4d5a-ab6f-0a08d52b360a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.3-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_58c24be7-bcae-4228-8dd1-8014c16f6a23"
id="sch.3-sec.3-he"><b>Time of marriage irrelevant</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A provision of this Act applies to married
persons whether married before or after the commencement of the
provision.</txt></block></level>
</level>
</content>


